# Aggregate, cookieless traffic counting. Leave unset to disable analytics entirely.
#
# Pick one provider and set its site token. All three are cookieless and record page views
# without building a visitor profile, which is what the Privacy Policy describes.
#
#   cloudflare  Cloudflare Web Analytics. Free on any host. ID is the beacon token.
#               https://dash.cloudflare.com  ->  Analytics & Logs  ->  Web Analytics
#   plausible   ID is your site domain, e.g. vacantneu.com
#   umami       ID is the website id (a UUID)
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=cloudflare
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=your-token-here
#
# Only for self-hosted Plausible or Umami:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_HOST=https://analytics.example.com
